  "instruction": "Complete the task using command-line or batch-capable tools from Altium Designer, OrCAD Capture, or OpenSCAD. The neutral hierarchical full-adder design `fulladd` is on the desktop. Flatten its schematic hierarchy and write `flat.json`. Requirements: - `flat.json` must contain `root_schematic`, `total_primitive_parts`, and `hier_block_expansions`. - Hierarchical blocks themselves do not count as primitive parts. - Each hierarchy expansion entry must include `parent`, `ref`, and `child`. [Software] Altium Designer is available at `D:\\Altium\\AD26\\X2.EXE`. OrCAD Capture is available at `D:\\orcad\\tools\\bin\\Capture.exe`. OpenSCAD is available as `openscad`.",
